{{/*
  The one row under the sign in card (Phase 7.1 plan 11, UI-SPEC 1e, departure
  D11; owner 2026-10-27: "should be designed more neatly"): Try the demo, Low
  data view, Disclaimer, Policy, in that order, four 44px outlined buttons with
  no box behind them and no underline at rest. Phase 5's row (Try the demo,
  Disclaimer, Policy; plan 05-07, D-03) gained the Low data view button here,
  and the separate Low data panel and its hint line are gone. The partial is
  called with the page's view model, so it reads LowDataDefault: when the Low
  data view is on, the second button turns it off. A partial so the next sign
  in card (Phase 8) keeps the row.
*/}}
{{define "login_ways_links"}}<div class="login-ways__row">
        <a class="btn" id="login-try-demo" href="/demo">Try the demo</a>
        {{if .LowDataDefault}}<a class="btn" id="login-low" href="/login?low=0">Turn off low data view</a>{{else}}<a class="btn" id="login-low" href="/login?low=1">Low data view</a>{{end}}
        <a class="btn" href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/policy">Policy</a>
        {{/* Reserved: the explainer video link goes beside Try the demo. Not drawn yet. */}}
      </div>{{end}}
